msgid "Controls how fast each particle moves and how quickly trails grow and decay. Higher values produce more energetic, rapid movement."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls how fast generations advance. Higher values evolve the cell population more rapidly."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls how fast snowflakes move. In Driving mode this affects horizontal and vertical scroll speed; in Falling modes it controls the rate of downward movement."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls how fast the circles move across the model. In radial mode, controls the speed of the outward ring expansion."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls how fast the curtain opens or closes. Values above 1 make the curtain complete its motion before the effect ends; values below 1 slow it down."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls how fast the pattern animates. For styles 1-5 this sets the scroll rate; for plasma styles 6-10 higher values produce slower, smoother animation."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls how fast the spirograph pattern rotates over time. Higher values make the drawing point orbit more quickly."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls how often random wind gusts occur. Higher values produce more frequent gusts that disturb the flame."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls how palette colors are assigned to active states. 'Graduate' blends through the palette over time. 'Cycle' assigns a different palette color to each timing interval. 'Allocate' assigns a fixed palette color based on the state's index number."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls how pixels are turned off. Black sets all pixels to black, Transparent leaves pixels unchanged, and the conversion modes swap black pixels to transparent or vice versa."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls how quickly node velocity decays. Lower values allow nodes to move more freely, while higher values make the tendril more sluggish."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls how quickly the flame responds to changes. Higher values make the flame snap to new brightness levels faster, creating a more erratic flicker."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls how quickly the spring force decays along the tendril chain. Higher values keep the tail tighter to the head; lower values let it wave more freely."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls how tall the flames reach. Higher values produce taller flames that extend further across the buffer."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls how the sensitivity threshold is scaled. None uses a fixed threshold, Individual Notes scales per bar based on each bar's peak, and All Notes scales based on the overall peak volume."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls how the warp intensity changes over the effect duration. Constant maintains full distortion, In ramps from none to full, and Out ramps from full to none."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls how tightly packed the plasma wave lines are. Higher values produce finer, more detailed patterns with more color transitions across the model."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls how timing track labels are interpreted. 'Default' uses labels as state names directly. 'Countdown' treats labels as numbers and counts down. 'Time Countdown' counts down from a time value (MM:SS). 'Number' displays digits for numeric values. 'Iterate' cycles through the listed states over the timing interval."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls the curtain motion. Open reveals the model by pulling the curtain away; close covers it. Combined modes perform both actions in sequence within the effect duration."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls the eye state. Open keeps eyes always open, Closed keeps them shut, Auto adds periodic random blinking, and (off) disables eye rendering."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls the horizontal deviation of each zigzag segment. Higher values make the bolt spread wider side-to-side."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls the intensity parameter of the selected FX animation. Its exact meaning varies by effect (e.g., brightness, size, or density)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls the magnitude of the tendril head movement. Higher values produce larger, more dramatic movements across the buffer."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls the radius of each circle. In radial mode, this sets the thickness of the concentric rings."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls the rate at which the warp distortion animates. Higher values produce faster-moving distortion patterns."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls the size of the base tile that gets reflected to fill the model. Smaller values create more repetitions; larger values create fewer, bigger reflections."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls the spacing interval used when sampling the pattern. Higher values skip more of the pattern, creating a coarser or more spread-out appearance."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls the spatial frequency of the distortion pattern. Higher values create tighter, more closely spaced ripples or waves."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls the speed of the selected FX animation. Higher values produce faster transitions and movement."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls the width of the decorative draped curve at the curtain edge. Higher values create a wider parabolic swag that hangs down from the top."
msgstr ""

msgid "Controls whether ripple waves expand outward (Explode), contract inward (Implode), or remain stationary (None) over the effect duration."
msgstr ""

